                        "username": "raviteja-b"
                    },
                    "message": "I still did not understand why do we need to this channel privilege in networkd application.\n\nnetworkd D-bus application is for managing ethernet interfaces network configurations and its common for redfish/ipmi external interfaces.\nsince this channel privilege is specific to IPMI use-cases, its recommended to handle channel privilege checks in ipmi rather than adding to networkd application"
                }
